{"id":"3148ea93514fc833","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-qhornrounding.md","title":"Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set","display":"thm-qhornrounding — Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-qhornrounding","aliases":["27-thm-qhornrounding"],"display":"thm-qhornrounding — Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set","depends_on":["[[27-df-qhornpolyhedron]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§6.10.2 Lemma 6.11","source_statement":"Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set","source_printed_pages":"317–318","source_pdf_pages":"341–342","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-qhornrounding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-qhornrounding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-qhornrounding — Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d50f975e656dde50\" href=\"?note=d50f975e656dde50\" title=\"27-df-qhornpolyhedron\">27-df-qhornpolyhedron</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.10.2 Lemma 6.11"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3148ea93514fc833\" href=\"?note=3148ea93514fc833\" title=\"Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set\">Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"317–318"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"341–342"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_D,\\rho,H\">\\(\\mathcal P_D,\\rho,H\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d50f975e656dde50\" href=\"?note=d50f975e656dde50\" title=\"27-df-qhornpolyhedron\">27-df-qhornpolyhedron</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(\\rho(\\alpha)\\in\\mathcal P_D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(\\rho(\\alpha)\\in\\mathcal P_D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\neq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\neq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists!H_*\\subseteq[n]\\;\\left(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\;(H(\\alpha)=H_*)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(H_*\\subseteq H(\\beta))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists!H_*\\subseteq[n]\\;\\left(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\;(H(\\alpha)=H_*)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(H_*\\subseteq H(\\beta))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一项约束中的非负数总和≤1，故超过1/2的至多一个，等于1/2的至多两个；ρ与补运算交换，取整保持约束。对两个可行点的泛型严格凸组合，半坐标集恰为二者半坐标集的交；有限次交再取整给出唯一最小 H_*。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-qhornpolyhedron","status":"resolved","id":"d50f975e656dde50","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-qhornpolyhedron]]","embed":false},{"target":"Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set","status":"resolved","id":"3148ea93514fc833","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-qhornpolyhedron","status":"resolved","id":"d50f975e656dde50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathcal P_D,\\rho,H$ 见 [[27-df-qhornpolyhedron]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_D,\\rho,H","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(\\rho(\\alpha)\\in\\mathcal P_D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\neq\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_D\\neq\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists!H_*\\subseteq[n]\\;\\left(\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathcal P_D\\cap\\{0,\\tfrac12,1\\}^n\\;(H(\\alpha)=H_*)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathcal P_D\\;(H_*\\subseteq H(\\beta))\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1640,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-qhornrounding|thm-qhornrounding — Half-integral feasibility and the unique minimum Q-Horn half-set]]"}],"outgoing":["d50f975e656dde50"]}